- Confirmed chapter and section anchors from the extracted table of contents:
  - Chapter 5 System Control, section 5.2.1 Device Identification, page 233.
  - Chapter 5 System Control, section 5.2.6.4 Dynamic Power Management, page 254.
  - Chapter 5 System Control, section 5.5 System Control Register Descriptions (System Control Offset), page 267.
